    <bpmn:process id="W_W5339" name="W5339. Equipment LTO/LTFRB Registration, Crane/Rigging Permit &amp; Roadworthiness Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Unit intake (registered/titled equipment); annual registration renewal; permit expiry
Frequency: Annual per registered unit; ad-hoc for crane/rigging permits
Volume: ~60–120 registered units; ~20–40 crane/rigging permits
Owner: Compliance Specialist (Fleet)
Participants: LTO/LTFRB liaison, Rental Fleet Manager, Permit Portfolio (VS-166)
Source: workflow W5339 — Equipment LTO/LTFRB Registration, Crane/Rigging Permit &amp; Roadworthiness Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5339_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5339_Lane1" name="Compliance Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5339_Lane2" name="LTO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5339_Lane3" name="Rental Fleet Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5339_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5339_Start5" name="Unit intake (registered/titled equipment); annual registration renewal; permit expiry">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5339_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5339_Task6" name="Identify which units require LTO/LTFRB registration (self-propelled/road-going)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify which units require LTO/LTFRB registration (self-propelled/road-going) vs. plant-only equipment.
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per intake</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5339_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5339_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5339_Task7" name="File/renew registration, emission, and roadworthiness (annual); obtain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: File/renew registration, emission, and roadworthiness (annual); obtain plates/decals.
Responsible (R): LTO/LTFRB Liaison
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5339_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5339_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5339_Task8" name="For crane/aerial/rigging classes, secure and renew the specific operating…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For crane/aerial/rigging classes, secure and renew the specific operating permits (links VS-165 PCAB/contractor).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5339_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5339_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5339_Task9" name="Record permits in the license/permit portfolio with expiry alerts (VS-166).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Record permits in the license/permit portfolio with expiry alerts (VS-166).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5339_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5339_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5339_Task10" name="Gate rental availability on valid registration/permit; block rental of expired…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Gate rental availability on valid registration/permit; block rental of expired units.
Responsible (R): Rental Fleet Manager
