Responsible (R): Rental Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5342_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5342_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5342_Task9" name="Benchmark attach-to-material-sales lift (does renting a mixer lift a…">
