Responsible (R): BI Analyst
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5342_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5342_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
