    <bpmn:process id="W_W5343" name="W5343. Fleet Age, Lifecycle Replacement, Disposition &amp; Trade-In Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Unit hits lifecycle age/hours; chronic high-repair-cost flag; or category exit
Frequency: ~10–20% of fleet/yr replaced
Volume: ~60–120 disposition decisions/yr
Owner: Rental Fleet Manager
Participants: Finance (Asset Accountant), Procurement (W5322), VS-35, Used-equipment buyer
Source: workflow W5343 — Fleet Age, Lifecycle Replacement, Disposition &amp; Trade-In Management</bpmn:documentation>
