Responsible (R): Rental Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Rental Fleet Manager
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5343_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5343_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5343_Task8" name="Decide refurbish vs. replace vs. dispose based on remaining economic life and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Decide refurbish vs. replace vs. dispose based on remaining economic life and the replacement capex (W5321/VS-40).
Responsible (R): Finance Business Partner
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5343_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5343_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5343_Task9" name="For replacement: order the successor unit (W5322) and plan the swap to minimize…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For replacement: order the successor unit (W5322) and plan the swap to minimize availability gap.
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: per W5322</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5343_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5343_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5343_Task10" name="Dispose via trade-in to OEM, sale to used-equipment buyer, or VS-155…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Dispose via trade-in to OEM, sale to used-equipment buyer, or VS-155 trade-in/B2B sale; ensure data/device wipe on telematics.
Responsible (R): Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5343_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5343_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5343_Task11" name="Retire the asset from the register, recognize gain/loss, and update the fleet…">
