Responsible (R): Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5343_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5343_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
