    <bpmn:process id="W_W5344" name="W5344. Cross-Store Equipment Rebalancing, Inter-DC Transport &amp; Demand Seasonality Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Utilization imbalance (W5342); seasonal demand shift; new hub ramp
Frequency: Monthly rebalancing review; ad-hoc transfers
Volume: ~200–400 inter-store/inter-DC transfers/yr
Owner: Rental Fleet Manager
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02/VS-127), Logistics Dispatcher, Store Managers
Source: workflow W5344 — Cross-Store Equipment Rebalancing, Inter-DC Transport &amp; Demand Seasonality Planning</bpmn:documentation>
