Responsible (R): Logistics Dispatcher
Accountable (A): Rental Fleet Manager
Duration: per transfer</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5344_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5344_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5344_Task9" name="Update the rental-asset home-location and availability ledger; confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Update the rental-asset home-location and availability ledger; confirm telematics re-home.
Responsible (R): Rental Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Rental Fleet Manager
Duration: per transfer</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5344_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5344_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
